00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,630
Woman: Hi, I'm Lan. Are you new here?

2
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:09,500
Man: Yes, I am. My name is Tom.

3
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:15,050
Woman: Nice to meet you, Tom. Where are you from?

4
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:19,890
Man: I'm from Canada. I live near the school now.

5
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:23,180
Woman: Oh, I live near the school too.

6
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:27,620
Man: Great! We can walk to class together.

